#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House5/scripts.inc:22
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House5_Text_TreeHousesAreGreat"
msgid ""
"The tree houses of FORTREE are great!\p"
"I think it's the number one town for\n"
"living together with POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"茵郁市的树屋真棒！\p"
"我觉得这里是最适合和\n"
"宝可梦一起生活的城镇。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House5/scripts.inc:27
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House5_Text_AdaptedToNature"
msgid ""
"POKéMON and people have adapted to\n"
"nature for survival.\p"
"There's no need to make nature\n"
"conform to the way we want to live.$"
msgstr ""
"宝可梦和人类都是为了\n"
"生存而适应了大自然。\p"
"我们没必要为了自己想要的\n"
"生活方式去改变大自然。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_House5/scripts.inc:33
msgctxt "FortreeCity_House5_Text_Zigzagoon"
msgid "ZIGZAGOON: Bufuu!$"
msgstr "蛇纹熊：噗呼——！$"
